.TH Install-Dependencies 1 "December 2025" "docker-homebridge" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
Install-Dependencies \- Install required dependencies for docker-homebridge
.SH SYNOPSIS
Install-Dependencies [\fB--help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Installs required system packages and dependencies for the docker-homebridge project.
The script supports both macOS (Darwin) and Linux (Debian/Ubuntu) platforms.
.SS macOS (Darwin)
.IP \(bu 2
Checks for Homebrew or MacPorts package manager
.IP \(bu 2
Installs Colima and Docker if no Docker runtime is available
.IP \(bu 2
Installs utilities: codespell, curl, gawk, gmake, gsed, grepcidr, ipcalc, jq, jwt-cli, moreutils, shellcheck, shfmt
.IP \(bu 2
Installs Azure CLI via Homebrew
.IP \(bu 2
Installs and configures pre-commit hooks
.SS Linux (Debian/Ubuntu)
.IP \(bu 2
Updates apt package lists
.IP \(bu 2
Installs packages: build-essential, codespell, curl, gawk, grepcidr, ipcalc, jq, make, moreutils, network-manager, pre-commit, python3-pip, shellcheck, shfmt
.IP \(bu 2
Calls Install-AzureClient to install Azure CLI
.IP \(bu 2
Calls Install-Docker to install Docker CE and related components
.IP \(bu 2
Calls Install-Rclone to install the latest Rclone release
.IP \(bu 2
Initializes the wiki git submodule if not present
.PP
On Linux, this script must be run with sudo/root privileges.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -h, --help
Show usage information and exit.
.SH USAGE
.RS
.nf
sudo ./build/Install-Dependencies
.fi
.RE
.SH DEPENDENCIES
.TP
.B Required:
apt, apt-get (Debian/Ubuntu package managers)
.TP
.B Installed packages:
curl, gawk, grepcidr, ipcalc, jq, zip, unzip
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR Install-AzureClient (1),
.BR Install-Docker (1),
.BR Install-Rclone (1)
